#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi paket\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode di halaman ini dikembangkan menggunakan persyaratan berikut.\n"
"Kami menyarankan untuk menggunakan versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To facilitate the development and reuse of custom transpilation code by the wider community of Qiskit users, the Qiskit SDK supports a plugin interface that enables third-party Python packages to declare that they provide extended transpilation functionality accessible via Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Untuk memudahkan pengembangan dan penggunaan kembali kode transpilasi kustom oleh komunitas pengguna Qiskit yang lebih luas, Qiskit SDK mendukung antarmuka plugin yang memungkinkan paket Python pihak ketiga untuk mendeklarasikan bahwa mereka menyediakan fungsionalitas transpilasi yang diperluas dan dapat diakses melalui Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently, third-party plugins can provide extended transpilation functionality in three ways:\n"
msgstr "Saat ini, plugin pihak ketiga dapat menyediakan fungsionalitas transpilasi yang diperluas dengan tiga cara:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [transpiler stage plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) provides a pass manager that can be used in place of one of the [6 stages](transpiler-stages) of a preset staged pass manager: `init`, `layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, and `scheduling`.\n"
msgstr "[Plugin tahap transpiler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins) menyediakan pass manager yang dapat digunakan sebagai pengganti salah satu dari [6 tahap](transpiler-stages) staged pass manager preset: `init`, `layout`, `routing`, `translation`, `optimization`, dan `scheduling`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [unitary synthesis plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin) provides extended functionality for unitary gate synthesis.\n"
msgstr "[Plugin sintesis uniter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.UnitarySynthesisPlugin) menyediakan fungsionalitas yang diperluas untuk sintesis gate uniter.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A [high-level synthesis plugin](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin) provides extended functionality for synthesizing \"high-level objects\" such as linear functions or Clifford operators. High-level objects are represented by subclasses of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class.\n"
msgstr "[Plugin sintesis tingkat tinggi](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPlugin) menyediakan fungsionalitas yang diperluas untuk mensintesis \"objek tingkat tinggi\" seperti fungsi linear atau operator Clifford. Objek tingkat tinggi direpresentasikan oleh subkelas dari kelas [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The rest of the page describes how to list available plugins, install new ones, and use them.\n"
msgstr "Sisa halaman ini menjelaskan cara membuat daftar plugin yang tersedia, menginstal yang baru, dan menggunakannya.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available plugins and install new ones {#list-available-plugins-and-install-new-ones}"
msgstr "Daftar plugin yang tersedia dan instal yang baru {#list-available-plugins-and-install-new-ones}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit already includes some built-in plugins for transpilation. To install more, you can use your Python package manager. For example, you might run `pip install qiskit-toqm` to install the [Qiskit TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm) routing stage plugin. A number of third-party plugins are part of the [Qiskit ecosystem](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"
msgstr "Qiskit sudah menyertakan beberapa plugin bawaan untuk transpilasi. Untuk menginstal lebih banyak, kamu bisa menggunakan package manager Python-mu. Misalnya, kamu bisa menjalankan `pip install qiskit-toqm` untuk menginstal plugin tahap routing [Qiskit TOQM](https://github.com/qiskit-toqm/qiskit-toqm). Sejumlah plugin pihak ketiga merupakan bagian dari [ekosistem Qiskit](https://qiskit.github.io/ecosystem/#transpiler_plugin).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available transpiler stage plugins {#list-available-transpiler-stage-plugins}"
msgstr "Daftar plugin tahap transpiler yang tersedia {#list-available-transpiler-stage-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins) function, passing the name of the stage whose plugins you want to list.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan fungsi [list_stage_plugins](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_plugins#qiskit.transpiler.preset_passmanagers.plugin.list_stage_plugins), dengan memberikan nama tahap yang plugin-nya ingin kamu daftarkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid " If `qiskit-toqm` were installed, then `toqm` would appear in the list of `routing` plugins.\n"
msgstr " Jika `qiskit-toqm` sudah terinstal, maka `toqm` akan muncul dalam daftar plugin `routing`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available unitary synthesis plugins {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Daftar plugin sintesis uniter yang tersedia {#list-available-unitary-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names) function.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan fungsi [unitary_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.unitary_synthesis_plugin_names).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List available high-level synthesis plugins {#list-available-high-level-synthesis-plugins}"
msgstr "Daftar plugin sintesis tingkat tinggi yang tersedia {#list-available-high-level-synthesis-plugins}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names) function, passing the name of the type of \"high-level object\" to be synthesized. The name corresponds to the [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan fungsi [high_level_synthesis_plugin_names](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.high_level_synthesis_plugin_names), dengan memberikan nama jenis \"objek tingkat tinggi\" yang akan disintesis. Nama tersebut sesuai dengan atribut [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) dari kelas [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) yang merepresentasikan jenis objek yang sedang disintesis.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the [HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager) class to list the names of all high-level synthesis plugins:\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menggunakan kelas [HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.synthesis.plugin.HighLevelSynthesisPluginManager) untuk membuat daftar nama semua plugin sintesis tingkat tinggi:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a plugin {#use-a-plugin}"
msgstr "Gunakan plugin {#use-a-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this section, we show how to use transpiler plugins. In the code examples, we use plugins that come with Qiskit, but plugins installed from third-party packages are used the same way.\n"
msgstr "Di bagian ini, kita akan menunjukkan cara menggunakan plugin transpiler. Dalam contoh kode, kita menggunakan plugin yang sudah disertakan bersama Qiskit, tapi plugin yang diinstal dari paket pihak ketiga digunakan dengan cara yang sama.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a transpiler stage plugin {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"
msgstr "Gunakan plugin tahap transpiler {#use-a-transpiler-stage-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a transpiler stage plugin, specify its name with the appropriate argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). The argument is formed by appending `_method` to the name of the transpilation stage. For example, to use the `lookahead` routing plugin, we would specify `lookahead` for the `routing_method` argument.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan plugin tahap transpiler, tentukan namanya dengan argumen yang sesuai pada [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) atau [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). Argumen tersebut dibentuk dengan menambahkan `_method` pada nama tahap transpilasi. Misalnya, untuk menggunakan plugin routing `lookahead`, kita akan menetapkan `lookahead` untuk argumen `routing_method`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The  `FakeSherbrooke` mock backend from `qiskit_ibm_runtime` is used in these examples, but you can try it on any Qiskit-compatible real or fake backend.  Your results might be different.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Backend tiruan `FakeSherbrooke` dari `qiskit_ibm_runtime` digunakan dalam contoh-contoh ini, tetapi kamu bisa mencobanya pada backend Qiskit-compatible mana pun, baik yang asli maupun palsu. Hasilmu mungkin berbeda.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a unitary synthesis plugin {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr "Gunakan plugin sintesis uniter {#use-a-unitary-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use a unitary synthesis plugin, specify its name as the `unitary_synthesis_method` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan plugin sintesis uniter, tentukan namanya sebagai argumen `unitary_synthesis_method` pada [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) atau [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unitary synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or used in [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these stages.\n"
msgstr "Sintesis uniter digunakan dalam tahap `init`, `translation`, dan `optimization` dari staged pass manager yang dikembalikan oleh [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) atau yang digunakan dalam [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). Lihat [Tahap Transpiler](transpiler-stages) untuk deskripsi tahap-tahap ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config` argument, a free-form dictionary, to pass options for the unitary synthesis method. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in unitary synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan argumen `unitary_synthesis_plugin_config`, sebuah dictionary bebas, untuk meneruskan opsi pada metode sintesis uniter. Dokumentasi metode sintesis seharusnya menjelaskan opsi yang didukungnya. Lihat [daftar ini](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#unitary-synthesis-plugins-2) untuk tautan ke dokumentasi plugin sintesis uniter bawaan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use a high-level synthesis plugin {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"
msgstr "Gunakan plugin sintesis tingkat tinggi {#use-a-high-level-synthesis-plugin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, create an [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) to\n"
"store the names of the plugins to use for various high-level objects. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, buat [HLSConfig](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.passes.HLSConfig) untuk\n"
"menyimpan nama plugin yang akan digunakan untuk berbagai objek tingkat tinggi. Misalnya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This code cell creates a high-level synthesis configuration that uses the `layers` plugin\n"
"for synthesizing [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) objects and the `pmh` plugin for synthesizing\n"
"[LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction) objects. The names of the keyword arguments correspond to the\n"
"[`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) attribute of the [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) class representing the type of object being synthesized.\n"
"For each high-level object, the list of given plugins are tried in sequence until one of them\n"
"succeeds (in the example above, each list only contains a single plugin).\n"
msgstr ""
"Baris kode ini membuat konfigurasi sintesis tingkat tinggi yang menggunakan plugin `layers`\n"
"untuk mensintesis objek [Clifford](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Clifford#clifford) dan plugin `pmh` untuk mensintesis\n"
"objek [LinearFunction](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.LinearFunction#linearfunction). Nama argumen kata kunci sesuai dengan\n"
"atribut [`name`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation#name) dari kelas [Operation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Operation) yang merepresentasikan jenis objek yang sedang disintesis.\n"
"Untuk setiap objek tingkat tinggi, daftar plugin yang diberikan dicoba secara berurutan hingga salah satunya\n"
"berhasil (dalam contoh di atas, setiap daftar hanya berisi satu plugin).\n"

# doq: emptied 2026-09-05, previous translation failed check.py
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to specifying\n"
"a plugin by its name, you can instead pass a `(name, options)` tuple, where the second element of the tuple is a dictionary containing options for the plugin. The documentation of the synthesis method should explain the options it supports. See [this list](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_synthesis_plugins#high-level-synthesis-plugins-2) for links to the documentation of the built-in high-level synthesis plugins.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Once you have created the `HLSConfig` object, pass it as the\n"
"`hls_config` argument to [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah kamu membuat objek `HLSConfig`, berikan sebagai argumen\n"
"`hls_config` pada [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) atau [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "High-level synthesis is used in the `init`, `translation`, and `optimization` stages of the staged pass manager returned by [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) or used in [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). See [Transpiler stages](transpiler-stages) for a description of these stages.\n"
msgstr "Sintesis tingkat tinggi digunakan dalam tahap `init`, `translation`, dan `optimization` dari staged pass manager yang dikembalikan oleh [`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager#qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) atau yang digunakan dalam [`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#qiskit.compiler.transpile). Lihat [Tahap Transpiler](transpiler-stages) untuk deskripsi tahap-tahap ini.\n"

