msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"    - [Buat plugin transpiler](/guides/create-transpiler-plugin).\n"
"    - Lihat [tutorial](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/tutorials) untuk contoh transpilasi dan menjalankan Circuit kuantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
